abstract: "Attribution and publication-status correction for the completed 120-patient, 85-death, 210-ROI analysis. Eight original masks were retained following a physician decision communicated by the author. Scientific numerical inputs and results are unchanged; no new training. Code licence only: source/derived data and third-party software retain their separate licences."
